stories.objective:
Establish the approved ink-toned, office-first application shell while preserving current production office behavior.

Scope intent:

- establish approved ink-toned application shell;
- compact Coffee Break identity/header;
- truthful global availability treatment;
- office-first spatial hierarchy;
- foundational typography/surface/control visual system;
- prepare desktop contextual-dock geometry;
- prepare compact room-first composition;
- preserve current production office behavior while shell changes;
- no office/character redraw in this story unless a minimal compatibility adjustment is necessary.

Rebuild the single office environment in the approved high-angle/top-down North Star language with authored anchors and truthful workstation context.

Scope intent:

- coordinated redraw of the single office;
- high-angle/top-down perspective;
- warm floor + restrained boundaries;
- visible desk tops/chairs/circulation;
- richer work areas;
- richer coffee/break area;
- bounded simple environmental props;
- authored anchors;
- foreground/background/occlusion layers;
- reactive Ari/Mina workstation visuals remain truthful;
- no character redesign beyond temporary compatibility if necessary.

Redesign Ari, Mina, and Sol as compact recognizable North Star agents while preserving trusted lifecycle and contextual presentation.

Scope intent:

- redesign all three agents in approved compact pixel-game language;
- preserve Ari/Mina/Sol identity;
- target existing ~20×24 class first;
- only justify a modest increase if approved requirements cannot fit;
- all five lifecycle states;
- workstation inhabitation;
- bounded Completed/Error acknowledgement;
- exact Sol coffee presentation;
- static reduced-motion equivalents;
- selection artwork compatible with small sprites.

Integrate existing selection and precise trusted agent information into the new office through contextual desktop and compact inline inspection.

Scope intent:

- recompose existing roster/selector;
- integrate world selection with new sprites/workstations;
- desktop contextual side dock;
- compact inline inspection;
- matching selected identity artwork;
- hierarchy: identity → lifecycle → freshness → exact activity → optional reason;
- larger accessible world hit regions where necessary;
- keyboard selection equivalent through React controls;
- preserve retained-state qualification.

Complete the coherent responsive North Star experience across both supported sizes and accessibility modes.

Scope intent:

- integrate shell, office, agents, selection and inspection;
- 1100×760 composition;
- 760×540 composition;
- room-first compact flow;
- inline compact inspection below office;
- long content;
- practical hit regions;
- keyboard/focus;
- retained state;
- reduced motion;
- overflow/reflow polish.

Perform integrated EP-05 acceptance and bounded polish, comparing the completed product against both the original North Star and the approved corrected composition. This is not a feature-expansion story.

Scope intent:

- integrated EP-05 visual acceptance;
- explicit original-North-Star comparison;
- explicit corrected-composition comparison;
- integrated lifecycle journey;
- workstation behavior;
- canonical and negative coffee cases;
- selection;
- connection/retained state;
- acknowledgement non-replay;
- desktop;
- compact;
- reduced motion;
- keyboard/focus;
- accessibility evidence;
- bounded polish only.
